	.string "{COLOR BLUE}{SHADOW LIGHT_BLUE}From: MR. FUJI\n"
	.string "To: {PLAYER}\p"
	.string "{FONT_MALE}{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY}Instead of hoping for the happiness\n"
